    <briefdescription>
<para>gRPC plugin integration tests: server start, loopback call, graceful shutdown. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Test IDs: GRPC-INT-01 through GRPC-INT-08</para>
<para>These tests exercise the GRPCServer and GRPCPlugin lifecycle without requiring a real network connection. When gRPC is available, a loopback server is started on an OS-assigned port; calls go through the gRPC runtime on 127.0.0.1. All tests are deterministic and require no external state.</para>
<para>Compile-time guard: if THEMIS_ENABLE_GRPC is not defined, the tests fall back to interface-only lifecycle assertions that compile without the gRPC runtime.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="grpc__plugin_8cpp" kindref="compound">src/rpc_grpc/grpc_plugin.cpp</ref> — implementation under test </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>plugins/rpc/ROADMAP.md — Phase 1 integration-test gate </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
